# Crash-reporting SDK, kept local rather than vendored.
#
# CRASH_PRIVACY.md already says an endpoint is enabled only after explicit
# consent, a privacy policy, a stated retention period and a configured DSN.
# None of those exist, nothing references the plugin and the .uproject does not
# enable it, so committing 800-odd files of it would be deciding by accident.
Plugins/Sentry/

# Heavy third-party asset packs (from the EG_OYUN_CIGKOFTE_1 project).
